    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i guess. but it's not just about the guilt. it's like the effort of trying to be better is just... exhausting. it feels like i'm running a race that has no finish line. i look at people who have it all figured out and i just feel so empty. does it ever actually get easier or are we just supposed to accept that we'll always be this miserable?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
